Package: baseline-desktop
Version: 0.2.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Maintainer: Baseline Project Maintainers <maintainers@baseline.invalid>
Description: Baseline web application and launcher for every account on this machine
 Installs the Baseline web application and its single launcher system-wide
 (root-owned, read-only for users) so any account can open it from the
 application menu. The launcher starts the app as the invoking user when no
 baseline-web service is installed. No service is enabled by this package.
